{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/7_Mwtx3zmB926fmJDeeirA","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:56:44.771387+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/7_Mwtx3zmB926fmJDeeirA","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>DoA Tsinghua</span></p></section></section></section><section><p><strong><span>清华大学天文系</span></strong></p><p><strong><span> 2025年天文学优秀大学生夏令营</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>2025年6月22日-6月24日</span></strong><span>，清华大学天文系将举办 “2025年天文学优秀大学生夏令营”，帮助有志于天文学研究的本科三年级学生了解天文学发展的前沿和清华大学天文系的发展现状，提前感受研究生生活，尽早确定未来的研究方向。</span><strong><span>夏令营期间将进行清华大学天文系接收2026年推荐免试博士研究生（直博生）的宣传工作。</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>关于我们</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>于</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>我</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>们</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>清华大学天文系成立于2019年3月，前身是2001年成立的清华大学天体物理中心。经过二十年的稳步发展，形成了一个学科布局合理、中青年结合的学术梯队，为国内外天文界输送了一批优秀的年轻人才。清华天文系现有教师近20人，构成以高能天体物理、星系和宇宙学、系外行星、射电天文四大特色方向为主的研究队伍，并在其他领域尤其是新兴领域上合理布局。同时，清华天文系充分利用清华工科优势，发展天文仪器和探测技术，并努力推动地面和空间项目，牵头了大型光谱巡天MUST项目和空间卫星HUBS项目。我们预计每年招收20名左右博士研究生，欢迎加入清华天文！</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/MVPvEL7Qg0Hh2ibaXT4DRXo5WhGuuE2KdkBmbGP2uEFibEFYbsuUVPsLHWjozg70KyRLweSlfTsFPBr25RD9kQwA/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请资格</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>1.拥护中国共产党的领导、愿为祖国建设服务、品德良好、遵纪守法；</span></p><p><span>2.研究兴趣浓厚，有较强的创新意识、创新能力和专业能力；</span></p><p><span>3.诚实守信，学风端正，不存在任何有违学术道德、专业伦理等行为；</span></p><p><span>4.身心健康，符合国家和我校规定的体检要求；</span></p><p><span>5.全国高校本科三年级在校生（2026届本科毕业生）；</span><span><br/></span></p><p><span>6.能在现就读学校取得推荐免试研究生资格；本科前5学期总评成绩在年级名列前茅。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/MVPvEL7Qg0Hh2ibaXT4DRXo5WhGuuE2KdkBmbGP2uEFibEFYbsuUVPsLHWjozg70KyRLweSlfTsFPBr25RD9kQwA/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请办法和审核</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>申请人应在</span><strong><span>2025年4月18日9:00-2025年5月19日9:00</span></strong><span>于清华大学研究生申请服务系统</span><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>https://yzbm.tsinghua.edu.cn）—中国（境内）—夏令营报名服务—清华大学天文系2025年天文学全国优秀大学生夏令营进行报名并提交材料，逾期不予受理。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>报名材料和注意事项参见天文系活动通知：</span></span><strong><span><br/></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span>https://astro.tsinghua.edu.cn/info/1089/1939.htm。</span></span></strong></p><p><span> </span></p><p><span>材料审核和优秀营员确认工作由夏令营专家评审组负责。夏令营选拔工作将于6月中旬完成，遴选入营和评选优秀营员的结果将通过清华大学研究生申请服务系统（https://yzbm.tsinghua.edu.cn）—中国（境内）—夏令营报名服务栏目发布，请申请人及时登录系统查看。</span></p><p><span>参营名单也将在清华大学天文系官方网站（http://astro.tsinghua.edu.cn/）上公布并通过电子邮件直接通知本人。</span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><span>确认优秀营员后，优秀营员将纸质申请材料邮寄至清华大学天文系研究生教学办公室杨老师。具体材料清单及要求将后续通知。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/MVPvEL7Qg0Hh2ibaXT4DRXo5WhGuuE2KdkBmbGP2uEFibEFYbsuUVPsLHWjozg70KyRLweSlfTsFPBr25RD9kQwA/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>联系方式</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>单位：清华大学天文系</span></p><p><span>邮箱：yangwch@tsinghua.edu.cn</span></p><p><span>电话：010-62796956</span></p><p><span>联络人：杨老师 </span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>welcome to join us</span></span><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>欢迎关注</span></p></section></section></section><section><p><strong><span>清华大学天文系</span></strong></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/icNfZmAxicIENatnRwibg7j2IpDShgQVC1krL6YJQO38nsOzicOoiaK4SNE32cvIzfWDM9NtrOKwTrIEg34iaR6t2JGw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><strong><span>微信号丨</span></strong></span><span>thudoa</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"101b588d33a24693ad5406bd7c2432a731c7d36b37b1ebc48605e32f316d45dd","textLength":1208,"sourceSha256":"457401ae6e949a1b581030b8cdc99931c52b8de182a1b929efea4f2b9dfa8265","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-c930f467e7fdae9dca7d","title":"2025年清华大学天文系 “2025年天文学优秀大学生夏令营”","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:56:44.771387+00:00"}
